  "subtitles": [
    {
      "id": 200,
      "text": "夜の七時を回った頃だった。夜の蝉も鳴くのをやめた頃。",
      "speaker": "ナレーター",
      "startTime": 1.0,
      "endTime": 4.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "color": "#e8e0d0",
      "bgColor": "#0a0a1a",
      "bgOpacity": 0.88,
      "outlineColor": "#2a2a4a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 201,
      "text": "加野川巳継たちは金網をよじ登り、方円寺小学校へ忍び込んだ。",
      "speaker": "ナレーター",
      "startTime": 4.0,
      "endTime": 7.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "color": "#e8e0d0",
      "bgColor": "#0a0a1a",
      "bgOpacity": 0.88,
      "outlineColor": "#2a2a4a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 202,
      "text": "いつも使っている教室に忍び込み、大胆にも蝋燭に火を灯した。",
      "speaker": "ナレーター",
      "startTime": 8.0,
      "endTime": 11.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "color": "#e8e0d0",
      "bgColor": "#0a0a1a",
      "bgOpacity": 0.88,
      "outlineColor": "#2a2a4a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 203,
      "text": "誰が持ち込んだのか、白くて太い蝋燭の先で紅い炎が揺らめいている。",
      "speaker": "ナレーター",
      "startTime": 11.0,
      "endTime": 14.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "color": "#e8e0d0",
      "bgColor": "#0a0a1a",
      "bgOpacity": 0.88,
      "outlineColor": "#2a2a4a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 204,
      "text": "学校で怪談話が人気になったからだ。",
      "speaker": "ナレーター",
      "startTime": 14.0,
      "endTime": 17.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "color": "#e8e0d0",
      "bgColor": "#0a0a1a",
      "bgOpacity": 0.88,
      "outlineColor": "#2a2a4a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 205,
      "text": "段々とつまらなくなってくる……それならもっと雰囲気を出して味わおう、ということになった。",
      "speaker": "ナレーター",
      "startTime": 17.0,
      "endTime": 20.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "color": "#e8e0d0",
      "bgColor": "#0a0a1a",
      "bgOpacity": 0.88,
      "outlineColor": "#2a2a4a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 206,
      "text": "「新体育館が建ってから、出るんだってー」",
      "speaker": "女の子",
      "startTime": 20.0,
      "endTime": 22.5,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 38,
      "color": "#f0d0ff",
      "bgColor": "#2d1b4e",
      "bgOpacity": 0.9,
      "outlineColor": "#4a2a6a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 207,
      "text": "「出るって、幽霊？」",
      "speaker": "男の子",
      "startTime": 22.5,
      "endTime": 24.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 38,
      "color": "#d0f0d0",
      "bgColor": "#1b2d1b",
      "bgOpacity": 0.9,
      "outlineColor": "#2a4a2a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 208,
      "text": "「そう！」",
      "speaker": "女の子",
      "startTime": 24.0,
      "endTime": 25.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 38,
      "color": "#f0d0ff",
      "bgColor": "#2d1b4e",
      "bgOpacity": 0.9,
      "outlineColor": "#4a2a6a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 209,
      "text": "「えーでも新体育館って今年建てられたばかりだよ？」",
      "speaker": "男の子",
      "startTime": 25.0,
      "endTime": 27.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 38,
      "color": "#d0f0d0",
      "bgColor": "#1b2d1b",
      "bgOpacity": 0.9,
      "outlineColor": "#2a4a2a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 210,
      "text": "「泣いてるんだって」「泣いてるの？　体育館で？」",
      "speaker": "会話",
      "startTime": 27.0,
      "endTime": 30.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "color": "#e8e0d0",
      "bgColor": "#0a0a1a",
      "bgOpacity": 0.88,
      "outlineColor": "#2a2a4a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 211,
      "text": "「でもね、新体育館って今年建てられたばかりで、変な事故は起きてないんだよ」",
      "speaker": "女の子",
      "startTime": 30.0,
      "endTime": 34.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 38,
      "color": "#f0d0ff",
      "bgColor": "#2d1b4e",
      "bgOpacity": 0.9,
      "outlineColor": "#4a2a6a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 212,
      "text": "巳継は怪談話に興味などないが、篠原佐和が参加すると言ったのが切っ掛けだった。",
      "speaker": "ナレーター",
      "startTime": 34.0,
      "endTime": 38.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "color": "#e8e0d0",
      "bgColor": "#0a0a1a",
      "bgOpacity": 0.88,
      "outlineColor": "#2a2a4a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 213,
      "text": "「ねえ、新体育館のお化けってどんな感じなの？」",
      "speaker": "佐和",
      "startTime": 38.0,
      "endTime": 41.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 38,
      "color": "#ffe0c0",
      "bgColor": "#3a1a0a",
      "bgOpacity": 0.9,
      "outlineColor": "#5a3010",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 214,
      "text": "その途端、しんと静まりかえった。",
      "speaker": "ナレーター",
      "startTime": 41.0,
      "endTime": 44.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "color": "#e8e0d0",
      "bgColor": "#0a0a1a",
      "bgOpacity": 0.88,
      "outlineColor": "#2a2a4a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 215,
      "text": "「じゃあ、見に行こうよ」　佐和が微笑みながらどんどん悪いことを言っている。",
      "speaker": "ナレーター+佐和",
      "startTime": 44.0,
      "endTime": 47.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "color": "#e8e0d0",
      "bgColor": "#0a0a1a",
      "bgOpacity": 0.88,
      "outlineColor": "#2a2a4a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 216,
      "text": "体育倉庫にある小窓の鍵が開いているのを発見した。",
      "speaker": "ナレーター",
      "startTime": 47.0,
      "endTime": 49.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "color": "#e8e0d0",
      "bgColor": "#0a0a1a",
      "bgOpacity": 0.88,
      "outlineColor": "#2a2a4a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 217,
      "text": "「開いてた……」「すげえ……。運いいな。行こうぜ」",
      "speaker": "会話",
      "startTime": 49.0,
      "endTime": 51.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 38,
      "color": "#e8e0d0",
      "bgColor": "#1b1b2d",
      "bgOpacity": 0.9,
      "outlineColor": "#2a2a4a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 218,
      "text": "皆で妙な連帯感を発揮し、壁をよじ登って小窓から中へ侵入した。",
      "speaker": "ナレーター",
      "startTime": 51.0,
      "endTime": 54.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "color": "#e8e0d0",
      "bgColor": "#0a0a1a",
      "bgOpacity": 0.88,
      "outlineColor": "#2a2a4a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 219,
      "text": "鍵を開ける時のガチャリという音が響いた。そして、ぎいと扉の開く音がした。",
      "speaker": "ナレーター",
      "startTime": 54.0,
      "endTime": 57.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "color": "#e8e0d0",
      "bgColor": "#0a0a1a",
      "bgOpacity": 0.88,
      "outlineColor": "#2a2a4a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 220,
      "text": "曇っていて月明りはない。誘導灯の灯りだけが体育館の中を照らしていた。",
      "speaker": "ナレーター",
      "startTime": 57.0,
      "endTime": 60.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "color": "#e8e0d0",
      "bgColor": "#0a0a1a",
      "bgOpacity": 0.88,
      "outlineColor": "#2a2a4a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 221,
      "text": "「なーんだ」「何も居ないね」",
      "speaker": "会話",
      "startTime": 60.0,
      "endTime": 62.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 38,
      "color": "#e8e0d0",
      "bgColor": "#1b1b2d",
      "bgOpacity": 0.9,
      "outlineColor": "#2a2a4a",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 222,
      "text": "巳継はまだ体育倉庫の中だった。そこからでも見えた。",
      "speaker": "ナレーター",
      "startTime": 62.0,
      "endTime": 65.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 950,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "color": "#e8e0d0",
      "bgColor": "#2d0a0a",
      "bgOpacity": 0.9,
      "outlineColor": "#4a1010",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "id": 223,
      "text": "体育館の中央あたりに誰かが居る。",
      "speaker": "ナレーター",
      "startTime": 63.0,
      "endTime": 65.0,
      "x": 960,
      "y": 900,
      "fontSize": 42,
      "color": "#ff4444",
      "bgColor": "#2d0000",
      "bgOpacity": 0.92,
      "outlineColor": "#ff0000",
      "outlineWidth": 2,
      "position": "bottom"
    }
  ],
